1
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,240
Mr. Gao,

2
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:20,760
Si,

3
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,200
why is your mom here?

4
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,600
Who is that man?

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,800
Isn't your dad dead?

6
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,800
Don't forget what you promised.

7
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,600
I've promised you

8
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,440
a lot of things.

9
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,200
I'm getting old.

10
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,440
I can't remember which one.

11
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,160
Mr. Gao,

12
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,200
what are you talking about?

13
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,010
Why are you here?

14
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,000
Who is he?

15
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,200
Let's go outside and talk.

16
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,360
Talk right here.

17
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,000
Tell me who this old man is.

18
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,440
You kept saying you wouldn't remarry,

19
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,440
and then you hooked up with this old guy,

20
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,400
right?

21
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:13,700
No wonder you won't come home.

22
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,800
You

23
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,240
are...

24
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:22,640
Stop pulling me.

25
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,960
I know who he is.

26
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,880
Mr. Gao, I'll be right back.

27
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,759
Si!

28
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,960
Take this money.

29
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,320
Mom is working.

30
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,360
You should go now.

31
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,039
So your job is selling yourself?

32
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:50,970
Is that how you talk to your mother?

33
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:54,200
It's just because that old man
has some money, right?

34
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:56,400
Have you lost all sense of shame
just for some money?

35
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,200
When my dad was in the hospital,

36
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,800
he gave you money, didn't he?

37
00:01:58,800 --> 00:01:59,200
You two were already
fooling around back then,

38
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,840
weren't you?

39
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:02,960
How could you do this to my dad?

40
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,600
Don't you feel ashamed

41
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,930
and guilty when you look
at my dad's photo?

42
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,200
Fine.

43
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:14,120
You hit me over a rich old man?

44
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,640
Zhao Wenjuan,

45
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,700
you're unbelievable.

46
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,720
I don't want your filthy money.

47
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,760
Just you wait.

48
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,560
Only two days left.

49
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,650
Are you feeling a bit stressed?

50
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:42,360
If seven days pass

51
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,800
and we find nothing,

52
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,720
it really means I was overthinking.

53
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,600
Just say what's on your mind.

54
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,260
Why are you acting like Jiang?

55
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,920
Asking too much makes me look weird.

56
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,200
Then don't ask.

57
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,480
I still want to ask.

58
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,600
This new lead you found,

59
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:12,060
about the one-person difference
in the two performances,

60
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:15,000
is it more for work or personal reasons?

61
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,380
Is that really necessary?

62
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:21,600
A traffic police captain slamming
on the brakes in the middle of the road.

63
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,200
Didn't you see the red light?

64
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,040
Keep acting.

65
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,720
I studied criminal psychology.

66
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,180
You think I can't read you?

67
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,960
You and that Song Yanfei,

68
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,380
there's a story there.

69
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:38,960
Are you cursing at me?

70
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,920
It wasn't me.

71
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,600
Song Yanfei cursed at me.

72
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,460
Unbelievable.

73
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:49,760
Heaven is my witness.

74
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,820
What's that noise?

75
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,640
Find out the truth!

76
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,440
Hello.

77
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,720
What's going on here?

78
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:56,680
Give me the truth about
my son Xiao Ze's death!

79
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,200
Take it easy.

80
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,600
Give me the truth about
my son Xiao Ze's death!

81
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,720
Take it easy.

82
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,800
This is the police station.

83
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,960
Calm down.

84
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,600
Quiet!

85
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:08,200
I will definitely give
you all an explanation.

86
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,400
Captains, you're finally here.

87
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,330
What's going on?

88
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,360
Well,

89
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:18,600
Xiao Ze's parents and relatives

90
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,600
came to make a scene after hearing

91
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,760
he died.

92
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,890
You know this is assaulting
a police officer, right?

93
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,160
Jiang'er,

94
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,240
please take his parents
to the reception room.

95
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,640
I'll talk to them myself.

96
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,880
Okay. And disperse

97
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,760
the rest of them.

98
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:33,960
It doesn't look good.

99
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,640
I'm on it.

100
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,800
Sir,

101
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,320
ma'am,

102
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,320
our captain asked you

103
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,440
to sit in the office inside for a while.

104
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:44,800
Let the rest of the family disperse first.

105
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,920
It's pointless

106
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,560
and inappropriate for you

107
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,800
to keep doing this.

108
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,520
It won't do anyone any good

109
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,440
if we actually have
to detain a few of you.

110
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,360
Alright, sir.

111
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,840
Let's go sit in the office for a bit.

112
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,520
Okay, let's go inside and talk.

113
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:57,720
You guys wait here for a moment.

114
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,560
Let's go.

115
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,520
This way, sir.

116
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,770
This is the current situation.

117
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,640
Please trust the police.

118
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,440
We will definitely find out the truth.

119
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,160
We won't give up

120
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,400
until the very end,

121
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,000
okay?

122
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,400
Okay.

123
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,660
Officer Li,

124
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,260
you sound sincere enough.

125
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,520
We trust you.

126
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,160
We'll leave our child's case to you.

127
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:24,680
You can perform the autopsy on our child.

128
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,320
Please do your best to investigate.

129
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,040
We

130
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:32,440
hope to see the day
when the truth comes out.

131
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,850
I need to take this call.

132
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,000
Thank you so much.

133
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,760
Zhang,

134
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:48,480
Li,

135
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,320
I asked around about that thing

136
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,780
you wanted me to look into.

137
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,460
How are you gonna thank me?

138
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,200
I'll have to

139
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:57,400
treat you to a meal.

140
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,240
No need.

141
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,480
I was just kidding.

142
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,640
That extra person

143
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:02,800
that day...

144
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,120
Her name is Bai Sha.

145
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,560
She's a dance teacher

146
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,080
at an art school.

147
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:08,920
By the way,

148
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,320
she seems to actually have
something going on

149
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,560
with Director Song.

150
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,040
I'm just saying.

151
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,120
Don't rat me out.

152
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,200
Of course not.

153
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,520
This intel is crucial.

154
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:20,960
Once I'm done with this,

155
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,560
I'll treat you to a nice meal.

156
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,360
I gotta go.

157
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,160
I have something to take care of.

158
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,659
That's all for now.

159
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,530
You should head back first.

160
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,800
My condolences.

161
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,800
We will keep investigating the case.

162
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,930
Please wait for our updates, alright?

163
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,610
I'm sorry for your loss.

164
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,250
Goodbye.

165
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,240
Take care.

166
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,000
Please don't cry.

167
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,980
Let's head out too.

168
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,650
Let's look into Bai Sha.

169
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,200
Who is Bai Sha?

170
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:19,920
Hello.

171
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:20,600
Hello.

172
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,200
Li Xingchen!

173
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,560
Zheng Haohao!

174
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,280
Yes, I changed my name.

175
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,960
I'm Bai Sha now,

176
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,360
formerly Zheng Haohao.

177
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,360
I really didn't expect it to be you.

178
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,560
They said the police were looking for me.

179
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,600
What's going on?

180
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,680
Let me introduce you.

181
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,280
This is our Captain Weng Wei.

182
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,680
Hello.

183
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,120
His name is Jiang Dahai.

184
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,159
Hello. Hello.

185
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:47,290
Just call him Jiang.

186
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,560
These two are my colleagues.

187
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,940
You literally know everyone.

188
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,280
Li Xingchen,

189
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,640
it's been about 10 years
since we last met, right?

190
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,520
Is this tattoo the only thing about me

191
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:04,980
that catches your eye now?

192
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,880
No.

193
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,620
I just think this tattoo is quite unique.

194
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,240
It's a real tattoo, right?

195
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,160
Not a sticker.

196
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,440
Dude, you're hilarious.

197
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:17,300
I'm not a 10-year-old kid.
Who still uses stickers?

198
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,200
I got this done abroad.

199
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,880
It costs US dollars.

200
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,440
Should I call you Officer Li now?

201
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,080
He's our captain.

202
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,880
You can just call him Captain Li.

203
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,840
Wow.

204
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,400
After all these years,

205
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:36,120
your friends are still so good-looking.

206
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,960
This young man is quite handsome.

207
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,919
Thank you, miss.

208
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,120
He's alright.

209
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,480
Here's the thing. We're here

210
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,679
to investigate a case

211
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:46,420
and want to verify some details with you.

212
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:47,960
Fourteen days ago,

213
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,480
did you attend a dance drama called

214
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,080
"Circle"?

215
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:58,280
Yes, I did.

216
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,840
Did Song Yanfei tell you?

217
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:03,720
Did Song Yanfei ask you to go?

218
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,570
Li Xingchen,

219
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,240
don't overthink it.

220
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,920
The past is in the past.

221
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,360
My name is Bai Sha now.

222
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,560
I'm no longer that

223
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,560
Zheng Haohao who was crazy for love.

224
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,720
Don't get the wrong idea.

225
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,480
Then why did Song Yanfei

226
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,940
suddenly ask you to attend
this dance drama?

227
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,920
He feels he owes me.

228
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:25,040
Others might not know about the past,

229
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,560
but don't you?

230
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,220
He came to me a few times
after I returned,

231
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,960
saying he had to pay me back.

232
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,280
Then recently,

233
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,600
he came to me again for his performance.

234
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,760
I turned him down every time.

235
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,760
Later, he sent me the script

236
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,680
and rehearsal videos.

237
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:43,090
And on the day of the show,
he even offered to send a car for me.

238
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,760
You know I'm in this industry too.

239
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,800
So,

240
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:49,400
I really couldn't resist the stage,

241
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,480
and I said yes.

242
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,400
He came to me again
on the day of the premiere.

243
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,640
And I turned him down.

244
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:57,720
It's boring.

245
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,280
Once is enough, right?

246
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:02,600
So that day, you put on the costume,

247
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,930
wore the mask, and went straight on stage?

248
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,760
Yeah, it made me super nervous.

249
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:10,200
So do you still remember your position,

250
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,280
or which character you played?

251
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,680
It's been days.

252
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,600
I can't remember.

253
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,680
Li Xingchen,

254
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,400
to be honest,

255
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:25,400
what happened back then hurt me deeply.

256
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:28,400
So I don't really care

257
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,800
about anything related to Song Yanfei.

258
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,200
What about the lines?

259
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,860
Do you remember them clearly?

260
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,760
It's a dance drama.

261
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:38,000
The focus is on the dance,

262
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,760
not the lines.

263
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,320
They were all pre-recorded.

264
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,120
Understood.

265
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:44,320
I don't even remember the lines.

266
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,730
Then where did you depart from?

267
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,520
From school.

268
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,930
He sent a commercial vehicle
to pick me up.

269
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:54,360
Can we take a look
at the surveillance footage?

270
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:57,800
No problem.

271
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,280
That call that day

272
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,600
was from Song Yanfei.

273
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,090
I have the call log here.

274
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:12,320
So you changed your clothes in the car?

275
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:15,200
Yes, time was too tight.

276
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,840
I didn't have time for makeup at all.

277
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:19,160
But luckily Song Yanfei said
there was a mask,

278
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:20,820
so I thought it didn't matter.

279
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,560
So

280
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,360
I just

281
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,730
tied my hair up in the car
and went on stage.

282
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:27,840
This commercial vehicle arrived
at the backstage of the Cultural Palace,

283
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,880
and you just wore the mask

284
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:31,410
and went straight on stage
to perform, right?

285
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,400
Yes.

286
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,240
Zheng Haohao,

287
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:36,480
you lied.

288
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:43,210
Before we came, we checked the surveillance
footage of the Cultural Palace that day.

289
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,600
The masked actress who went in

290
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:52,880
doesn't have a tattoo on her collarbone.

291
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,210
How do you explain that?

292
00:11:57,960 --> 00:12:00,040
I don't care if you're Bai Sha now

293
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,280
or Zheng Haohao from the past.

294
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:03,480
As an old classmate,

295
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,680
I must remind you.

296
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:08,040
Bringing you here means

297
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:10,400
this isn't that simple.

298
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:17,440
I was afraid it would
affect the performance,

299
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,490
so I covered it with concealer.

300
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,360
That really is me.

301
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:23,440
Okay.

302
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,880
Captain Weng, Jiang'er,

303
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:28,560
this person is
an old acquaintance of mine.

304
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:29,960
To avoid any conflict of interest,

305
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,820
I'm requesting to recuse myself.

306
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:32,600
You guys

307
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,180
just do things by the book.

308
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,530
Interrogate as needed.

309
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,360
Okay.

310
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,540
I need to remind you one more time.

311
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,040
This

312
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,760
involves a murder,

313
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,140
a major felony.

314
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,170
Watch yourself.

315
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:52,840
Li Xingchen!

316
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,000
I'm telling you,

317
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:00,840
that person wasn't me that day.

318
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,700
But it was indeed Song Yanfei who called.

319
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:12,840
Hello?

320
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,480
What made you call me?

321
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,640
I

322
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,840
need a huge favor from you urgently.

323
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,840
Do you have time?

324
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:23,450
Song Yanfei,

325
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:25,800
we've known each other
for almost 20 years.

326
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,560
This is the first time
you've begged me like this.

327
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,040
Tell me, what is it?

328
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,040
It's nothing major.

329
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:32,640
It's just that the premiere
of my dance drama is quite important,

330
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:35,440
but an actress can't make it today.

331
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:38,000
I want to ask you to fill in for her.

332
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,040
Sure, that's easy.

333
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:42,240
You have to treat me to a meal afterward.

334
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,280
Absolutely.

335
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,840
When should I head over?

336
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,360
Now.

337
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:47,760
Now?

338
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,280
Okay.

339
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,600
You're really in a rush.

340
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,160
Do I need to prepare anything?

341
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,560
No, just bring yourself.

342
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:56,280
Song Yanfei called to ask for my help,

343
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,560
saying there was an empty spot
in his dance drama.

344
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,360
The premiere was very important to him,

345
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,240
and an actress couldn't make it
at the last minute.

346
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:03,840
He asked me to fill in.

347
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,800
I figured it wasn't a big deal,

348
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:06,760
so I agreed.

349
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:09,040
Then why wasn't it you

350
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,700
who went backstage in the end?

351
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:13,240
How would I know what he was up to?

352
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,880
He actually picked up
another girl halfway.

353
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:18,410
Then, when I was almost there,
he called to say

354
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:20,160
the actress had arrived,

355
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:22,160
and apologized for making me
take a trip for nothing.

356
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,320
I was so mad.

357
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,400
Don't you think he was
just messing with me?

358
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,360
Later,

359
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,880
he said since I was already there,

360
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,400
he'd invite me to watch the show,

361
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:32,000
and we could grab a bite
and catch up afterward.

362
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,040
I thought I'd just let it go.

363
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,370
Since he put it that way,

364
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:36,400
I agreed.

365
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,800
In the end, we did have dinner together.

366
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,360
I'm sorry, Haohao.

367
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,320
I'm really sorry.

368
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,380
I apologize to you.

369
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,980
Please forgive me.

370
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:46,200
My name is Bai Sha now.

371
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,760
The old Zheng Haohao is dead.

372
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:51,200
And the Bai Sha in front of you
is about to be pissed off to death by you.

373
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,360
Bai Sha,

374
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,480
I'm sorry. I was really wrong.

375
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,440
At least give me a chance to explain.

376
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:01,880
How about I chug this bottle?

377
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:13,880
Enough.

378
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,680
Are you really going to drink it?

379
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:18,080
I yield to you.

380
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,530
That's enough. Tell me,

381
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:23,090
what exactly happened?

382
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,860
It's like this.

383
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,400
This girl

384
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,720
is my girlfriend.

385
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,330
Ex-girlfriend.

386
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:34,800
And my current girlfriend

387
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:37,440
is the investor of this dance drama.

388
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:40,160
Then this ex-girlfriend

389
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,760
has been pestering me a bit.

390
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,840
The reason for the pestering is

391
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:46,440
that we created this dance drama together.

392
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,640
So...

393
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,160
I get it.

394
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,920
Song Yanfei!

395
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:55,560
After how you treated me back then,

396
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:58,690
you still want me to take the blame
and clean up your mess?

397
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:00,440
Things are different now.

398
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:03,560
Did I owe you in a past life?

399
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,200
I owe you.

400
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,800
No, no, no. Tell me,

401
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:08,240
how will you repay me?

402
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:13,120
I'll write a lead role
for you in a dance drama.

403
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,680
No need.

404
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:15,460
That's really not necessary.

405
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,460
I'll get a tattoo here too.

406
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,640
I'm really sorry.

407
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:22,490
I'll take

408
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:23,970
a penalty drink.

409
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,760
You're forgiven.

410
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:27,400
Eat more.

411
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,330
You're so sweet.

412
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:31,000
You're the best person I've ever met.
Thank you.

413
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:31,920
He said

414
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,440
it was his last tie to his ex-girlfriend.

415
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,600
He couldn't tell his current girlfriend,

416
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,560
so he asked me to put on this act.

417
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:42,560
He told me not to tell anyone,

418
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,930
or all his efforts would be in vain.

419
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,560
But I never expected

420
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:48,040
the police to come to me,

421
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,840
let alone you.

422
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:53,440
If you had told us this earlier,
everything would be fine,

423
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:54,640
right?

424
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:58,520
Do you remember his ex-girlfriend's name?

425
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,200
Why would I ask that?

426
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,400
Do you remember what she looks like?

427
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:05,000
Let me give you a rough description.

428
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:05,599
Jiang'er,

429
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:06,890
show her the photos.

430
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:10,569
Take a look at these.

431
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:21,680
Her.

432
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:23,520
It's her.

433
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,440
Are you sure?

434
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:26,160
I'm sure. It's her.

435
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:34,960
Just as I expected.

436
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,600
The extra one

437
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,760
is her.

